From: loom2 vendored patch (upstream city96/ComfyUI-GGUF PR #479, 2026-09-05, open at pin time)
Subject: Fix KeyError 'default_num_special_tokens' when recreating the Mistral tekken tokenizer from GGUF metadata

Core ComfyUI (>= 0.38) from_tekken_json requires config["default_num_special_tokens"]; Mistral's tekken.json
uses 1000. Applied locally until the PR is merged and the node pin moves (recorded in engine/nodes.lock).

diff --git a/loader.py b/loader.py
index 7cefb11..ca617c8 100644
--- a/loader.py
+++ b/loader.py
@@ -395,7 +395,7 @@ def gguf_tekken_tokenizer_loader(path, temb_shape):
     if model_str == "gpt2":
         if temb_shape == (131072, 5120): # probably Mistral
             data = {
-                "config": {"num_vocab_tokens": 150000, "default_vocab_size": 131072},
+                "config": {"num_vocab_tokens": 150000, "default_vocab_size": 131072, "default_num_special_tokens": 1000},
                 "vocab": [],
                 "special_tokens": [],
             }
